   "body": "i did disabled compression in past using the NO_COMPRESSION option trying to fix the memory leak that continue to exist in pyOpenSSL implementation, but i've re-enabled it after fixing the leak with the multi-process implementation.\n\nhttps://github.com/globaleaks/Tor2web-3.0/commit/e42cea60614af97efd010c3bfba96bc8dc4562f5\n\ni'm going re-disable it by re-adding:\n\n```\n+        # http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CRIME_(security_exploit)\n+        # https://twistedmatrix.com/trac/ticket/5487\n+        # SSL_OP_NO_COMPRESSION = 0x00020000L\n+        ctx.set_options(0x00020000)\n```\n",
   "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
   "pin": null,
